    "description": "**Result message:** Untrusted user input in findOne() function can result in NoSQL Injection.\n**Snippet:**\n```      const record = await this.model.findOne({\n        attributes: ['recordId', [Sequelize.fn('MAX', Sequelize.col('version')), 'maxVersion']],\n        where: {\n          categoryCode,\n          recordId: { [Op.ne]: recordId },\n        } as unknown as any,\n        group: ['recordId'],\n        having: Sequelize.where(Sequelize.fn('MAX', Sequelize.col('version')), Op.eq, Sequelize.literal('MAX(version)')),\n      });```\n",
